I am in the room.
My suitcase is on the floor.
I open the suitcase.
There are clothes in the suitcase.
I take the clothes out.
There is also a picture in the suitcase.
It is my family's picture.
In the picture, my mother is there, and my father is there.
My younger sister Sofia is also there.
My elder brother Diego is there.
Our dog Lola is also there.
I place the picture on the table.
I look at the picture.
My family is in Mexico.
But now they are in my room.
The room is not empty now.
This is my room now.
I smile.
